WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Aditya Soni ji bahut naamcheen doctor sahab hain, Mahatma Gandhi mein.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Unka treatment chal raha tha, mere mama ji hain.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Unko saal bhar se dikkat thi.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Abhi das din ka treatment hua hai, 90% usse sudhar aaya hai.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Thodi ghabrahat rehti thi, woh theek hai.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Karte hain, karte hain, karte hain, karte hain, karte hain.
